<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss August unemployment rate steady at 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss August unemployment rate steady at 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 4.5 percent in August, unchanged from July, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>					  Aug 1996  July 1996   Aug 1995</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed    4.5 pct    4.5 pct    4.0 pct</p>
<p> Number of jobless		  163,705    161,586    145,726</p>
<p> Job vacancies			5,850	6,246	5,534</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
